#==[99999]-未知物品 Unknown Items==
# THE SAFETY NET. Anything no rule above matched lands here - a new league item, a
# base we have not curated, a class whose category is still empty.
#
# It SHOWS, deliberately and at every strictness level. The rule this filter is
# built on is that a Hide must name what it hides (a Class or a BaseType), so
# nothing is ever hidden by accident; whatever falls through has to be visible
# instead. In Ruthless a missed drop costs far more than a little noise.
#
# The styling is meant to be recognisable as "uncurated", not pretty: if you see
# one of these in game, that base wants a home in base_mapping.
Show
    SetFontSize 40
    SetTextColor 255 255 255 255
    SetBorderColor 0 200 255 255
    SetBackgroundColor 0 40 60 255
    PlayAlertSound 4 200
    PlayEffect Cyan
    MinimapIcon 1 Cyan Kite
